{% set show_internal = (render_mode == "full" or render_mode == "thoughts" or render_mode == "thought" or render_mode == "transform" or render_mode == "book" or render_mode == "equipment") %}
{% if show_internal and dom_actor.loaded and dom_actor.is_slave %}
    {% if existsIn(dom_actor, "family_history_rank") and dom_actor.family_history_rank > 0 %}
        {% if dom_actor.family_history_rank == 1 %}
        - Family history: kept by force; family did not settle their fate kindly.
        {% else if dom_actor.family_history_rank == 2 %}
        - Family history: family accepted their enslavement.
        {% else if dom_actor.family_history_rank == 3 %}
        - Family history: family paid regarding their enslavement.
        {% else if dom_actor.family_history_rank == 4 %}
        - Family history: family was scared into accepting their fate.
        {% else if dom_actor.family_history_rank == 5 %}
        - Family history: freed in a family settlement.
        {% else if dom_actor.family_history_rank == 6 %}
        - Family history: family was recruited into slavery work.
        {% endif %}
    {% endif %}
    {% if existsIn(dom_actor, "experience") %}
        - Experience counts: pain {{dom_actor.experience.pain}}, bondage {{dom_actor.experience.bondage}}, shame {{dom_actor.experience.shame}}, rape {{dom_actor.experience.rape}}, sex {{dom_actor.experience.sex}}, sex with others {{dom_actor.experience.sex_with_others}}, sex for money {{dom_actor.experience.sex_for_money}}, orgasm {{dom_actor.experience.orgasm}}, broken {{dom_actor.experience.broken}}, brainwashed {{dom_actor.experience.brainwashed}}, shock {{dom_actor.experience.shock}}, promise {{dom_actor.experience.promise}}, praise {{dom_actor.experience.praise}}, comfort {{dom_actor.experience.comfort}}, insult {{dom_actor.experience.insult}}, threat {{dom_actor.experience.threat}}, told off {{dom_actor.experience.toldoff}}
    {% endif %}
    {% if existsIn(dom_actor, "trauma_days") %}
        - Trauma days (broken timer): {{dom_actor.trauma_days}}
    {% endif %}
{% endif %}
